WHAT THE LPPL LETS YOU DO
==========================

In short, the LPPL lets you:

  * use the Work as-is, for any purpose;
  * distribute verbatim copies of the Work;
  * distribute a modified version of the Work, PROVIDED you
    either rename it (so it no longer collides with the
    original babel-malagasy package name and files) or clearly
    mark it as a modified version and follow the other
    conditions in section 6 of the full license text linked
    above.

This summary is not a substitute for the license itself; the
full LPPL 1.3c text at the URL above is the binding license for
this Work.
